    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lisaalwa lia Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siise esio Omuruki Akosito arusia lilaka lie khubala babaandu mu bwami bwe Barumi bwoosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khuno nikhwo khukhwaba khubalwa khwe khunyoa. Kurenio niye owaba omuruki owa Siria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako buli mulala acha khukhwiandikisia mu lukoba lwe wabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu aama mu lukoba lwa Nasareti mu Kalilaya acha mu lukoba lwe Betelehemu mu Buyuda, abuundu niio Omwami Daudi asaalwa. Yosefu aacha ebweeneyo sikila aba owe lisaaye lio mwami Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu aacha khukhwiandikisia ne Maria niye aba naseleele, ne Maria aaba ali ne nda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga ne baba mu Betelehemu siise sia Maria sie khukhwirusiakho siola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asaala omwana wewe omubele omusoleeli amura mu bikubo bie babaana mala amwalisia khu lwelo nilwo chikhaafu chaliilangakho, sikila se banyoola niio baulukhila munju eye bakeni tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Babaayi ne malaika",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaayi babao mu sibala esio babayaanga kamatuuli kabwe akhaba siilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika owo Mwami ababonekhela, mala luyali lwo Mwami lwabakhosiakho. Baaba ne buuri bukali po, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nio malaika ababoolela ali, “Mukharia tawe! Ndi ano ne Elomo Endayi khwinywe, ekhareere ekhoyo engali khu baandu boosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endaalo yino mu Lukoba lwa Daudi Kristo Omwami omuonia wefwe asaalilwe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne sino silaba simanyisio khwinywe: Mulanyoola omwana areerwe mu bikubo bie babaana mala bamwaliisie khu lwelo nilwo chikhaafu chililangakho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siise esio bamalaika be mwikulu bakali babonekha ne bafumia Wele bali:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga malaika ne babarurao bakobola mwikulu, babaayi baboolana bali, “Khe khuche e Betelehemu khubone sisiindu sisiikholeekhe sino nisio Omwami Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akhubooleele efwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako, bacha khangu banyoola Maria ne Yosefu, mala babona omwana ali khu lwelo nilwo chikhaafu chaliilangakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga babaayi babona omwana baboolela basaasi niko malaika aaba nababooleele khu mwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boosi babaulila niko babaayi baloma, bauka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maria abiikha kamakhuwa kano koosi mu mwoyo mala akebaasiakho lukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaayi bakobolayo ne bafumia Wele khulwe bibiindu bioosi nibio baba ne baulile ne khubona, biaba busa nga malaika ne aaba nababooleele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu aebwa lisina",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
